NODE start
  STORYTELLER: Ah, a new face! Sit, sit. Have I told you the one about the miller and the missing goat?

  CHOICE Go on, then.
    GOTO story
  END

  CHOICE Maybe another time.
    END dialogue
  END

NODE story
  STORYTELLER: There isn't much to it, really. The goat came back on its own. Still, good story, wasn't it?

  CHOICE Sure was.
    END dialogue
  END
